  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DialogueText: 'OH WOW UMMM-<n>

    Are you sure that piece cares about you? It
    seems like a jerk.<n>

    It''s shape is so prickly, it makes it almost impossible
    for any piece to get close.<n>

    Your puzzle board would probably be happier
    without it.'
